# Response headers for the Cloudflare Workers static-asset sites
# (dailyjammtest from `tst`, dailyjammdev from `dev`).
#
# GitHub Pages IGNORES this file, so it has no effect on production
# dailyjamm.com. Production headers must be set with a Cloudflare Transform
# Rule - see the Security Headers section in CLAUDE.md.
#
# WARNING: the X-Robots-Tag line below keeps the test and dev sites out of
# search results. It is safe here only because production is served by
# GitHub Pages, which never reads this file. If production is ever moved to
# a Cloudflare Worker, delete that line first or the live site is deindexed.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=()
